ge of some dried out wildflowers\u0022 class=\u0022image lazyload background-image\u0022 data-bgset=\u0022https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/nh5ngawj/wildflowers-7688547_1920.jpg?width=800\u0026amp;height=600\u0026amp;v=1dc077d6186c180\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 1x, https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/nh5ngawj/wildflowers-7688547_1920.jpg?width=1600\u0026amp;height=1200\u0026amp;v=1dc077d6186c180\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 2x\u0022 data-sizes=\u0022auto\u0022 role=\u0022img\u0022 style=\u0022background-image:url(\u0027https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/nh5ngawj/wildflowers-7688547_1920.jpg?width=160\u0026amp;height=140\u0026amp;v=1dc077d6186c180\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75\u0027)\u0022\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C!--// IMAGE --\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/section\u003E\n\u003Csection class=\u0022content component usn_cmp_breadcrumb base-bg base-bg-solid\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022component-inner\u0022\u003E\n\u003Csection class=\u0022breadcrumb-trail\u0022 data-os-animation=\u0022fadeIn\u0022 data-os-animation-delay=\u00220s\u0022 data-os-animation-duration=\u00221.2s\u0022\u003E\n\n\u003C/section\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/section\u003E\n\u003Csection class=\u0022content component usn_cmp_text base-bg base-bg-solid\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022component-inner\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022info\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022text base-text\u0022 data-os-animation=\u0022fadeIn\u0022 data-os-animation-delay=\u00220s\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAnother week, another Umbraco update! Following swiftly on from our recent \u003Ca href=\u0022/3chillies-blog/umbraco-update-2026-pricing-new-uk-office-and-more/\u0022 title=\u0022Umbraco update: 2026 pricing, new UK office and more\u0022\u003EUmbraco round-up post\u003C/a\u003E covering the pricing for 2026, new UK office and other recent news, Umbraco HQ has now announced \u003Ca href=\u0022https://umbraco.com/blog/umbraco-17-beta-is-out/\u0022 rel=\u0022noopener\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EUmbraco 17 is now in beta\u003C/a\u003E. With characteristic Umbraco modesty, the announcement lets us know that the release is \u201Cless scary than it sounds\u201D.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn this brief post we explore what is in the new release as well as its expected timetable.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EBeta is actually a new phase for Umbraco releases\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOne notable development about the announcement is the concept of the \u201CBeta\u201D phase itself. Previously this pre-release phase was called the \u201CRelease Candidate\u201D but this caused some confusion, so now for every release from 17 onwards there will be three release phases:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBeta:\u003C/strong\u003E occurring six weeks before final release, where all features have all been developed and there is just work on bug fixes.\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERelease Candidate:\u003C/strong\u003E occurring about four weeks before launch, which identifies any regression issues based on feedback from the professional Umbraco community\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFinal release: \u003C/strong\u003EFor Umbraco 17 this should be around the end of November.\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EUmbraco 17 is a new Long-Term Supported (LTS) release\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAs a new LTS release, Umbraco 17 incorporates all the changes and new features over two years introduced since the last LTS, which in this case was Umbraco 13.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBecause this is an LTS, some customers may have been waiting to upgrade to this new release. This means they will introduce several major new elements, including the backoffice which has been rebuilt from the ground up with a new UI. For more information about the core features of previous releases, see our previous posts:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022/3chillies-blog/what-are-the-main-features-of-umbraco-14/\u0022 title=\u0022What are the main features of Umbraco 14?\u0022\u003EWhat are the main features of Umbraco 14?\u003C/a\u003E\u00A0\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022/3chillies-blog/umbraco-update-from-the-release-of-umbraco-15-to-the-launch-of-umbraco-engage/\u0022 title=\u0022Umbraco update: From the release of Umbraco 15 to the launch of Umbraco Engage\u0022\u003EUmbraco update: From the release of Umbraco 15 to the launch of Umbraco Engage\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022/3chillies-blog/exploring-the-latest-umbraco-product-update/\u0022 title=\u0022Exploring the latest Umbraco product update\u0022\u003EExploring the latest Umbraco product update\u003C/a\u003E\u00A0\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022/3chillies-blog/seven-takeaways-from-the-2025-umbraco-codegarden-keynote/\u0022 title=\u0022Seven takeaways from the 2025 Umbraco Codegarden keynote\u0022\u003ESeven takeaways from the 2025 Umbraco Codegarden keynote\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EIt may be a substantial upgrade from Umbraco 13 to 17\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe announcement goes into some detail of what to expect in terms of effort if you are upgrading. In summary:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EIf you are upgrading from 15 or 16, it should be \u201Cstraightforward\u201D\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EGoing from 13 to 17 will be more substantial, but the extent of the effort depends on various criteria.\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EThe most effort associated with upgrading from 13 to 17 is if you have any custom extensions or if you have any third-party packages that are not compatible with the latest version.\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf you\u2019re using a pre-13 version, then we recommend speaking to your digital agency partner about upgrading, or \u003Ca href=\u0022/contact/\u0022 title=\u0022Contact\u0022\u003Efeel free to chat with us\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EUmbraco 17 comes with a smattering of new features\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMore detail will be available soon when the Release Candidate drops, but there are some new capabilities including support for Microsoft .NET 10, more consistent handling of dates across the platform, and also the introduction of load balancing for the backoffice.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EWant to discuss Umbraco 17?\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBecause it is a LTS release, the launch of Umbraco 17 is significant. Need to discuss the new release and whether you should upgrade? \u003Ca href=\u0022/contact/\u0022 title=\u0022Contact\u0022\u003EGet in touch!\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/section\u003E\n\u003Csection class=\u0022content component usn_cmp_subpagelisting base-bg base-bg-solid\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022component-inner\u0022\u003E\n\u003C!-- Introduction --\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022component-introduction row justify-content-start text-left\u0022 data-os-animation=\u0022fadeIn\u0022 data-os-animation-delay=\u00220s\u0022 data-os-animation-duration=\u00221.2s\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022info col\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\u0022heading base-heading\u0022\u003ERelated Blog posts\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C!--// Introduction --\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022repeatable-content tab-content\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv aria-labelledby=\u0022nav_tab_dad7080a-b2cd-4ca0-9f3a-484d8d951ca8_0\u0022 class=\u0022tab-pane show active\u0022 id=\u0022nav_dad7080a-b2cd-4ca0-9f3a-484d8d951ca8_0\u0022 role=\u0022tabpanel\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022component-main row slides listing listing_basic-grid\u0022 data-slick=\u0027{\u0022dots\u0022: false ,\u0022arrows\u0022: false ,\u0022slidesToShow\u0022: 3, \u0022responsive\u0022: [{\u0022breakpoint\u0022: 768,\u0022settings\u0022: {\u0022slidesToShow\u0022: 2}},{\u0022breakpoint\u0022: 575,\u0022settings\u0022: {\u0022slidesToShow\u0022: 1}}],\u0022fade\u0022: false }\u0027\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022item item-blog items-3 item_text-below text-left\u0022 data-os-animation=\u0022fadeIn\u0022 data-os-animation-delay=\u00220s\u0022 data-os-animation-duration=\u00221.2s\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022inner\u0022\u003E\n\u003Ca href=\u0022/3chillies-blog/umbraco-update-product-and-strategy-highlights-from-the-winter-keynote/\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022image image-opacity-100 image_hover-opacity-40\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cpicture\u003E\n\u003Csource data-srcset=\u0022https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/himj5avd/floral-5096532_1280.jpg?width=800\u0026amp;height=600\u0026amp;v=1dc0779d6a2c120\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 1x, https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/himj5avd/floral-5096532_1280.jpg?width=1600\u0026amp;height=1200\u0026amp;v=1dc0779d6a2c120\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 2x\u0022 height=\u0022600\u0022 type=\u0022image/webp\u0022 width=\u0022800\u0022/\u003E\n\u003Cimg alt=\u0022Abstract image of pale flowers against a dark blue bacground\u0022 class=\u0022lazyload\u0022 data-srcset=\u0022https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/himj5avd/floral-5096532_1280.jpg?width=800\u0026amp;height=600\u0026amp;v=1dc0779d6a2c120\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 1x, https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/himj5avd/floral-5096532_1280.jpg?width=1600\u0026amp;height=1200\u0026amp;v=1dc0779d6a2c120\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 2x\u0022 height=\u0022600\u0022 src=\u0022https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/himj5avd/floral-5096532_1280.jpg?width=160\u0026amp;height=120\u0026amp;v=1dc0779d6a2c120\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75\u0022 width=\u0022800\u0022/\u003E\n\u003C/picture\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022info\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\u0022heading md base-heading\u0022\u003EUmbraco Update: Product and strategy highlights from the Winter Keynote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022text base-text\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThis year\u2019s Umbraco Winter Keynote has just dropped, and in this post we summarise the main points of interest.\u00A0\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/a\u003E\n\u003C!-- Meta --\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022meta base-text\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\u0022date\u0022\u003E\u003Ctime\u003E12 Feb 2026\u003C/time\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022categories base-text\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\n\u003Ca href=\u0022/3chillies-blog/umbraco/\u0022 rel=\u0022NOINDEX, FOLLOW\u0022 title=\u0022Umbraco\u0022\u003EUmbraco\u003C/a\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C!--// Meta --\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022item item-blog items-3 item_text-below text-left\u0022 data-os-animation=\u0022fadeIn\u0022 data-os-animation-delay=\u00220s\u0022 data-os-animation-duration=\u00221.2s\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022inner\u0022\u003E\n\u003Ca href=\u0022/3chillies-blog/umbraco-update-umbraco-17-released-a-new-enterprise-offering-and-more/\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022image image-opacity-100 image_hover-opacity-40\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cpicture\u003E\n\u003Csource data-srcset=\u0022https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/jrrnb2c3/golden-gate.jpg?width=800\u0026amp;height=600\u0026amp;v=1dc0773c26e1520\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 1x, https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/jrrnb2c3/golden-gate.jpg?width=1600\u0026amp;height=1200\u0026amp;v=1dc0773c26e1520\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 2x\u0022 height=\u0022600\u0022 type=\u0022image/webp\u0022 width=\u0022800\u0022/\u003E\n\u003Cimg alt=\u0022Close up image of the pillar of a bridge taken against a bright blue sky\u0022 class=\u0022lazyload\u0022 data-srcset=\u0022https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/jrrnb2c3/golden-gate.jpg?width=800\u0026amp;height=600\u0026amp;v=1dc0773c26e1520\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 1x, https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/jrrnb2c3/golden-gate.jpg?width=1600\u0026amp;height=1200\u0026amp;v=1dc0773c26e1520\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 2x\u0022 height=\u0022600\u0022 src=\u0022https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/jrrnb2c3/golden-gate.jpg?width=160\u0026amp;height=120\u0026amp;v=1dc0773c26e1520\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75\u0022 width=\u0022800\u0022/\u003E\n\u003C/picture\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022info\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\u0022heading md base-heading\u0022\u003EUmbraco update: Umbraco 17 released, a new enterprise offering and more\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022text base-text\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003EIn this post we walk you through the main points of the recent flurry of Umbraco updates and what they mean for Umbraco users in 2026.\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/a\u003E\n\u003C!-- Meta --\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022meta base-text\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\u0022date\u0022\u003E\u003Ctime\u003E22 Jan 2026\u003C/time\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022categories base-text\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\n\u003Ca href=\u0022/3chillies-blog/umbraco/\u0022 rel=\u0022NOINDEX, FOLLOW\u0022 title=\u0022Umbraco\u0022\u003EUmbraco\u003C/a\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C!--// Meta --\u00